{block beforeContent}
<div class="container">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12">
            <div class="p-5 text-white bg-dark">
                <h3>Download SmartCGMS</h3>
                <p class="lead">Please, fill the form below, so we can send the download link to your e-mail.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
{/block}

{block content}

<h3>SmartCGMS</h3>

<p>Below you can find a form, which will send you a link to download a distribution of SmartCGMS for MS Windows 64-bit, macOS 64-bit and Debian GNU/Linux 64-bit. For a different system, please, <a href="diabetes@mail.kiv.zcu.cz">let us know</a>. This distribution of SmartCGMS is free for non-commercial use and academic research. It cannot be used for a treatment or any other purpose as they require a different license and an appropriate certification.</p>
<p>When publishing any results obtained using SmartCGMS, you must include the following citation:<ol><li><i>T. Koutny and M. Ubl, "SmartCGMS as a Testbed for a Blood-Glucose Level Prediction and/or Control Challenge with (an FDA-Accepted) Diabetic Patient Simulation", Procedia Computer Science, Volume 177, pp. 354-362, 2020</i></li></ol></p>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-12">
        {form requestDownloadForm}
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12">
                {label name /}
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 form-group">
                {input name class=>'form-control'}
                <div class="space-1em"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12">
                {label phone /}
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 form-group">
                {input phone class=>'form-control'}
                <div class="space-1em"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12">
                {label address /}
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 form-group">
                {input address class=>'form-control'}
                <div class="space-1em"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12">
                {label email /}
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 form-group">
                {input email class=>'form-control'}
                <div class="space-1em"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 form-group">
                <div class="d-grid gap-2">
                    {input submit class=>'btn btn-dark btn-lg'}
                </div>
                <div class="space-1em"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        {/form}
    </div>
</div>
